    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-250-267">實は成りぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-267-281">草葉かげ</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281-296"><rb>小</rb><rt>ささ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-296-307">やかに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-307-321">赤うして</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-321-338">名も知らぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-338-357">實は成りぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-357-374">大空みれば</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-374-391">日は遠しや</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-391-409">輝輝たる夏の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-409-424"><rb>午</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-424-435">さがり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-435-444">野路に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-444-459"><rb>隱</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459-467">れて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-467-483">唱ふもの</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-483-491">魔よ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-491-517">名を蛇と呼ばれて</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-517-541"><rb>拗者</rb><rt>すねもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-541-546">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-546-561"><rb>呪</rb><rt>のろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-561-564">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-564-579"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-581-597">節なれぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-597-614">野に生ひて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-614-631">光なき身の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631-652"><rb>運命</rb><rt>さだめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-652-663">悲しや</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-663-675"><rb>世</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-675-678">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-678-699"><rb>逆</rb><rt>さかしま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-699-704">に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-704-720">感じては</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-720-737">のろはれし</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-737-751">夏の日を</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-751-762">妖艷の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-762-773">蠱物と</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-773-797"><rb>接吻</rb><rt>くちづけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-797-809">交す蛇苺</seg></p>
    </body>
